  "claim": "A television series created for Netflix, which Defenders producer and writer Liz Friedman is especially known for her work on, is the second in the series of the shows that lead to \"The Defenders\" miniseries after Daredevil released on Netflix earlier.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Jessica Jones (TV series). Sentence: Marvel's Jessica Jones, or simply Jessica Jones, is an American web television series created for Netflix by Melissa Rosenberg, based on the Marvel Comics character of the same name.\nPage: Jessica Jones (TV series). Sentence: It is set in the Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU), sharing continuity with the films of the franchise, and is the second in a series of shows that lead to \"The Defenders\" crossover miniseries.\nPage: The Defenders (miniseries). Sentence: Marvel's The Defenders, or simply The Defenders, is an American web television miniseries created by Douglas Petrie and Marco Ramirez for Netflix, based on the Marvel Comics characters Daredevil, Jessica Jones, Luke Cage and Iron Fist, who form the eponymous superhero team.\nPage: Liz Friedman. Sentence: Liz Friedman is an American television producer and television writer known especially for her work on \"\", \"Young Hercules\", \"House\" and \"Jessica Jones\".",
